    <question_explanation no="15" id="PRB-BDD29EC58786F140-Q15">
      <question_stem>극수 $P$인 3상 유도전동기에서 동기속도 $N_{\begin{aligned}s\end{aligned}}$ [rpm], 회전자속도 $N_{\begin{aligned}\end{aligned}}$ [rpm], 슬립 $s$, 2차입력 $P_{2}$ [W], 2차동손 $P_{c2}$ [W], 기계적 동력으로 변환되는 출력 $P_{o}$ [W], 토크 $T$ [N·m]라고 할 때, 관계식이 옳은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>극수</keyword>
        <keyword>유도전동기에서</keyword>
        <keyword>동기속도</keyword>
        <keyword>회전자속도</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$\frac{P_{c2}}{P_{o}}$ ＝ $\frac{N_{s} - N}{N}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기기기 · 유도전동기의 관계식
정답은 ④이다. 슬립 s = (Ns − N)/Ns, N = (1 − s)Ns이고, P2 : Pc2 : Po = 1 : s : (1 − s)이다. 따라서 Pc2/Po = s/(1 − s) = (Ns − N)/N이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$s$ ＝ $\frac{2 \pi}{P} ( N{_{s}} - N )$</choice_text>
          <commentary>s에 2π/P가 곱해질 이유가 없다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$N$ ＝ $\frac{1 - s}{s} N_{\begin{aligned}s\end{aligned}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>N = (1 − s)Ns이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$T$ ＝ $\frac{30}{\pi} \frac{P_{2}}{N} s$</choice_text>
          <commentary>T = (30/π)(P2/Ns)이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$\frac{P_{c2}}{P_{o}}$ ＝ $\frac{N_{s} - N}{N}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>Pc2/Po = (Ns − N)/N이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="16" id="PRB-BDD29EC58786F140-Q16">
      <question_stem>2차측 무부하전압이 220 [V]인 단상변압기에 10 [Ω]의 저항부하를 연결할 때, 전압변동률이 10 [%]이다. 이때, 2차측 전류[A]는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>차측</keyword>
        <keyword>무부하전압</keyword>
        <keyword>단상변압기</keyword>
        <keyword>저항부하</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>20</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기기기 · 전압변동률과 2차측 전류
정답은 ②이다. 전압변동률 10%이므로 무부하전압 220 V = 1.1 × 부하 시 전압에서 부하 시 전압은 200 V이다. 2차측 전류 = 200 ÷ 10 = 20 A이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>10</choice_text>
          <commentary>10 A는 계산 결과와 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>20</choice_text>
          <commentary>20 A이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>30</choice_text>
          <commentary>30 A는 계산 결과와 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>40</choice_text>
          <commentary>40 A는 계산 결과와 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
